                    </div>
                    <div class="tool-card-body">
                        <p class="tool-description">
                            Leonardo AI specializes in creating game assets, concept art, and professional illustrations. Features AI Canvas for precise editing and a variety of fine-tuned models. Great for game developers and digital artists.
                        </p>
                        <div class="tool-features-list">
                            <span class="feature-tag">Game Assets</span>
                            <span class="feature-tag">AI Canvas</span>
                            <span class="feature-tag">Fine-tuned Models</span>
