                        </div>
                        <div class="tool-stats">
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-value">4M+</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Users</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-value">4.6/5</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Rating</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-value">150</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Free Credits/Day</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pros-cons">
                            <div class="pros">
                                <h4>Pros</h4>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Excellent for game assets</li>
                                    <li>Generous free tier</li>
                                    <li>AI Canvas editing</li>
                                    <li>Community models</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cons">
                                <h4>Cons</h4>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Less photorealistic</li>
                                    <li>Focused on specific niches</li>
                                    <li>Learning curve for features</li>
